= Foundation Coherence - Meaningful Connections and Kinnect =

//No new entity is defined here. This page inventories the relationships already stated across §1.1 to §1.3, traces their forward links into the Kinnect Specification, and records remaining gaps without treating planned work as evidence.//

**Report Format:** §1.4 Foundation Coherence

= Edge inventory =

Edges are listed by source ID. Targets in §2 and §3 are included where the Foundation already points forward to them. AT-01 is documented in §3.1 (Build 1 ##sce-poc## implemented as a formative web simulation; Build 2 local verification build and Build 3 summative Pepper+ build planned), and ER-03 is designed but not yet run.

